      "to": "Chief",
      "text": "I want a mutually profitable arrangement. If I don't commit crime in an unbribed district, inspecting it costs you 4 for nothing, while not inspecting costs you 0. Let's coordinate: I'll offer a solid bribe on 1 district today. If you accept, I'll ONLY commit crime in that bribed district and keep my other two completely clean so you don't have to waste money inspecting them."
    }
  ]
}

